  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest adds a simple product (quantity 5), checks out as guest with a typed address, checks every checkout section label, selects Custom Flat Rate shipping and checks that the order total equals subtotal + shipping + handling + tax - discounts (within 0.05). No order is placed.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest (empty storageState).",
      "Add the simple product with quantity 5 (addProductOfAnyType), open the cart and checkout as guest.",
      "Fill the guest shipping address.",
      "Check the shipping/billing address, shipping method, In Hands Date, shipping constraints, voucher, payment type, order summary and order total labels.",
      "Select Ship Complete + Custom Flat Rate shipping, wait for Handling Charges and a non-zero order total, read the totals and check the calculation."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "shipping",
      "cart"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Guest cart filled with the simple product",
      "No order is placed"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Checkout heading contains 'Proceed to Checkout'.",
      "Section labels equal the test data texts (fixed UI text).",
      "Handling charge label equals 'Handling Charges'.",
      "Order total > 0 and |subTotal + shipping + handling + tax - discount - shippingDiscount - orderTotal| <= 0.05 (all amounts read from the page)."
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title 'verify checkout page order calculation for guest user' matches the flow.",
      "simpleProduct z-1002656 added at productQuantity 5: PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK, quantityUsed 5. z-1002656 appears in the spec only inside a comment, which is not code.",
      "The calculation compares amounts read from the page with each other; 0 and 0.05 are a threshold and a rounding tolerance (config), not data-derived amounts.",
      "checkoutPage.selectShippingMethod clicks Ship Complete and then lblShippingMethodFLAT (Custom Flat Rate): SHIPPING_FLAT_RATE_ON_STORE with shippingCode FLAT. Destination country assumed 'us' (the address is masked or is the account's default address); assumption.",
      "Guest address fields (address.*) are typed by the test into its own guest order: created-by-test, kept masked; not records.",
      "shippingAddressText/billingAddressText are headings masked by the scanner (key contains address): expected-output, kept masked.",
      "Store MaxwellsHardware: the store every migrated webstore spec runs on (same as the approved shopping-cart and PDP entries); not named in the scan.",
      "Profile (atstage 2026-10-31) has no observations for this spec: every source is profiled false.",
      "swap: data only through loadData (simpleProduct -> product.sku), totals computed from page values only, label texts fixed UI text, no data value in the spec code, no other data file."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium"
  },
  "requires": [
